29323::$$$message_0211_0000_0000$$$::I walk to the shed.[lr]::
29324::$$$message_0211_0000_0001$$$::There isn't anything I need to fix urgently. I just feel like going there.::
29325::$$$message_0211_0001_0000$$$::I sit cross-legged on the usual sheet and look aimlessly around the room.[lr]::
29326::$$$message_0211_0001_0001$$$::".........Okay."[lr]::
29327::$$$message_0211_0001_0002$$$::It's been long enough.[lr]::
29328::$$$message_0211_0001_0003$$$::I can't really think of anything to do, so I'll go back to my room and sleep.::
29329::$$$message_0211_0002_0000$$$::But...[lr]::
29330::$$$message_0211_0002_0001$$$::Why did I come to the shed at night?:V¹n